        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2 font-display">Sukses!</h3>
        <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Admin telah menolak draft publikasi ini. Email notifikasi beserta catatan telah dikirimkan ke pelanggan.
        </p>
        <button class="closeModalBtn w-full py-3 bg-stone-200 text-stone-700 font-bold rounded-xl text-sm hover:bg-stone-300 transition-all" data-modal="rejectSuccessModal">Tutup</button>
